(window.webpackJsonp=window.webpackJsonp||[]).push([[59],{1169:function(n){n.exports=JSON.parse('{"html":"<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/images/20210330120838.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<h2 id=\\"冒泡排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#冒泡排序\\">#</a> 冒泡排序</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>相邻比较、逆序就换，每轮把剩下里最大的「冒」到末尾，最多 <code>n-1</code> 轮</li>\\n<li>平均 / 最坏 <code>O(n²)</code>，加 <code>swapped</code> 提前退出后最好 <code>O(n)</code>；空间 <code>O(1)</code></li>\\n<li>稳定的前提是相等不换：比较写 <code>&gt;</code>，写成 <code>&gt;=</code> 就不稳定了</li>\\n<li>两个必加优化：一轮没交换就 <code>break</code>、内层边界减掉已排好的 <code>i</code></li>\\n<li>双向冒泡（鸡尾酒排序）一轮正反各扫一遍，小元素在末尾时更快，但上界还是 <code>O(n²)</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>冒泡就是相邻两个比，逆序就换，每一轮把剩下里最大的那个推到最后。</strong> 平均最坏都是 <code>O(n²)</code>，但只要加一个 <code>swapped</code> 标记，某一轮一次都没换就直接退出，已经有序的数组扫一遍就完，最好情况是 <code>O(n)</code>。还有个很隐蔽的点是比较只能用 <code>&gt;</code>，写成 <code>&gt;=</code> 相等的也会换，稳定性就没了。工程里没人手写它，面试问它其实是看你能不能讲清稳定性和最好最坏情况。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>思路</strong>：相邻两个元素比较，逆序就交换。每一轮把当前未排序区间里最大的元素&quot;冒&quot;到末尾，n-1 轮后有序。</p>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>指标</th>\\n<th>值</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\\n<td>平均/最坏 <code>O(n²)</code>，最好 <code>O(n)</code>（已有序且做了提前退出优化）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(1)</code>（原地）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td><strong>稳定</strong>（相等时不交换）</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p><strong>必须加的两个优化：</strong></p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">bubbleSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> swapped <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">false</span>                       <span class=\\"token comment\\">// ① 提前退出</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>              <span class=\\"token comment\\">// ② 用 > 而不是 >=，保证稳定</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        swapped <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">true</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>swapped<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">break</span>                       <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 这一轮没换过 → 已经有序</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>提前退出</strong>：没有它，已排好序的数组仍然要跑满 <code>O(n²)</code>。加上之后最好情况降到 <code>O(n)</code>，这是面试官常追问的点。</li>\\n<li><strong>比较用 <code>&gt;</code> 不是 <code>&gt;=</code></strong>：相等时不交换才能保持稳定性 —— 写成 <code>&gt;=</code> 就把稳定排序变成了不稳定的，这是个很隐蔽的错误。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>为什么面试还问它？</strong> 不是因为它实用（工程上没人手写冒泡），而是因为它是理解<strong>稳定性</strong>和<strong>最好/最坏情况差异</strong>最简单的载体。能主动说出&quot;稳定性取决于相等时换不换&quot;和&quot;提前退出让最好情况变 <code>O(n)</code>&quot;，比默写代码更有价值。</p>\\n<p>下面是具体实现：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>通过相邻元素比较和交换，使得每一趟循环都能找到未排序的子数组。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<h3 id=\\"实现\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#实现\\">#</a> 实现</h3>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">bubbleSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">list</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> list\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<h3 id=\\"优化\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#优化\\">#</a> 优化</h3>\\n<h4 id=\\"单向冒泡\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#单向冒泡\\">#</a> 单向冒泡</h4>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>标记在一轮比较汇总中，如果没有需要交换的数据，说明数组已经是有序的，可以减少排序循环的次数。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">bubbleSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">list</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> mark <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">true</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 如果在一轮比较中没有出现需要交换的数据，说明数组已经是有序的</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp\\n        mark <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">false</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>mark<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">break</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> list\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<h4 id=\\"双向冒泡\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#双向冒泡\\">#</a> 双向冒泡</h4>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>普通冒泡排序一轮只找到最大值或最小值其中之一，双向冒泡则多一轮筛选，既可以找到最大值，也可以找到最小值。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">bubbleSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">list</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> low <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> high <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>low <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> high<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> mark <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">true</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 找到最大值放在右边</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> low<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> high<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp\\n        mark <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">false</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    high<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 找到最小值放在左边</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> high<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> low<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp\\n        mark <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token boolean\\">false</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    low<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>mark<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">break</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> list\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>双向冒泡比普通冒泡快在哪？</strong></p>\\n<p>普通冒泡里小元素每轮只能往前挪一格，<code>[2, 3, 4, 5, 1]</code> 要跑 <code>4</code> 轮才能把 <code>1</code> 送到最前。双向冒泡反向那一趟直接把 <code>1</code> 带回去，一轮就有序。比较次数能少一些，但最坏还是 <code>O(n²)</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把两个比较改成 <code>&gt;=</code> 和 <code>&lt;=</code>，结果还对吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>排出来还是有序的，但相等的元素也会被交换，稳定性没了。比如按价格排订单，同价的两单会前后颠倒，原来按时间排好的先后顺序就乱了。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>正向扫完为什么马上 <code>high--</code>，不等一轮结束再减？</strong></p>\\n<p>正向扫完，最大值已经落在 <code>high</code> 上，反向那趟没必要再碰它。先减就少比一次；放到最后减结果也对，只是多做一次无用比较。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>反向循环写成 <code>j &gt;= low</code> 会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>j === low</code> 时会去比 <code>list[low]</code> 和 <code>list[low - 1]</code>，<code>low</code> 为 <code>0</code> 时读的是 <code>list[-1]</code>，也就是 <code>undefined</code>。比较结果是 <code>false</code> 所以不报错，但已经越过左边界了。条件必须是 <code>j &gt; low</code>，这种越界用空数组、单元素、两元素倒序三个用例就能测出来。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>前端要排十万条日志，有人说双向冒泡一轮找两个最值所以够快，你怎么看？</strong></p>\\n<p>不够。<code>O(n²)</code> 十万条就是几十亿次比较，主线程直接卡死。直接 <code>logs.sort((a, b) =&gt; a.time - b.time)</code>，<code>V8</code> 里是 <code>TimSort</code>，稳定、<code>O(n log n)</code>；数据再大就放到 <code>Web Worker</code> 或者让后端排好再给。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"选择排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#选择排序\\">#</a> 选择排序</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>每轮在未排序区找最小值，和这个区间的第一个元素换</li>\\n<li>最好最坏都是 <code>O(n²)</code>：有没有序都得把剩下的全扫一遍才知道谁最小，没法提前退出</li>\\n<li>不稳定：跨位置交换，<code>[5a, 5b, 2]</code> 排完是 <code>[2, 5b, 5a]</code></li>\\n<li>唯一优点：交换最多 <code>n-1</code> 次，写入代价高时才有意义</li>\\n<li>示例代码每轮都交换，<code>minIndex === i</code> 时应该跳过</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>选择排序就是每一轮从剩下的里面挑最小的，放到前面。</strong> 因为每轮都要把剩下的全扫一遍才能确定谁最小，所以有没有序都是 <code>O(n²)</code>，这点不如冒泡和插入。它还不稳定，原因是交换是跳着换的：<code>[5a, 5b, 2]</code> 第一轮 <code>2</code> 和 <code>5a</code> 一换，两个 <code>5</code> 的顺序就反了。它唯一说得出口的优点是交换次数少，最多 <code>n-1</code> 次，适合「比较便宜、写入很贵」的场景。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>思路</strong>：每一轮从未排序区间里找出最小的元素，和该区间的第一个元素交换。</p>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>指标</th>\\n<th>值</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\\n<td><strong>恒定 <code>O(n²)</code></strong>（最好最坏都一样，没有提前退出的余地）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(1)</code></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td><strong>不稳定</strong></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>交换次数</td>\\n<td><strong>最多 <code>n-1</code> 次</strong>（这是它唯一的优点）</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">selectionSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> min <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> min <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> j\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>min <span class=\\"token operator\\">!==</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>为什么它不稳定？</strong> 因为交换是&quot;跨越式&quot;的。举个例子：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>[5a, 5b, 2]  →  第一轮找到最小值 2，和第一个 5a 交换\\n[2, 5b, 5a]  →  两个 5 的相对顺序被颠倒了 ❌\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>这是选择排序区别于冒泡和插入的关键 —— 后两者都是相邻交换，天然稳定。</p>\\n<p><strong>它唯一的优势：交换次数少。</strong></p>\\n<p>冒泡最坏要交换 <code>O(n²)</code> 次，选择排序<strong>最多只交换 <code>n-1</code> 次</strong>。当&quot;交换&quot;这个操作的成本特别高时（比如元素是大对象、或者数据在慢速存储上），选择排序反而更划算。</p>\\n<p><strong>和冒泡的对比是高频追问：</strong></p>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th></th>\\n<th>冒泡</th>\\n<th>选择</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>最好情况</td>\\n<td><code>O(n)</code>（可提前退出）</td>\\n<td><code>O(n²)</code>（无法优化）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>交换次数</td>\\n<td>最多 <code>O(n²)</code></td>\\n<td>最多 <code>n-1</code></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td>稳定</td>\\n<td><strong>不稳定</strong></td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p>下面是具体实现：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>依次找到剩余元素的最小值或者最大值，放置末尾或者开头。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<h3 id=\\"实现-2\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#实现-2\\">#</a> 实现</h3>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">selectSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">list</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> minIndex\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    minIndex <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>minIndex<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        minIndex <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> j\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n\\t\\tlist<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>minIndex<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>minIndex<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> list\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>[5a, 5b, 2]</code> 用选择排序，两个 <code>5</code> 的顺序为什么会反？</strong></p>\\n<p>第一轮找到最小值 <code>2</code>，和第一个位置的 <code>5a</code> 交换，<code>5a</code> 被直接甩到了最后，越过了 <code>5b</code>，结果是 <code>[2, 5b, 5a]</code>。冒泡、插入都是相邻挪动，没有这个问题。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>内层比较写成 <code>list[j] &lt;= list[minIndex]</code> 有什么区别？</strong></p>\\n<p>相等时也会更新 <code>minIndex</code>，每轮选中的是最后一个同值元素，交换后同值元素的顺序被打乱得更厉害。写 <code>&lt;</code> 好一点，但选择排序本身就不稳定，改比较符救不回来。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>已经有序的数组，示例代码还是每轮都做一次交换，怎么改？</strong></p>\\n<p>加个判断：<code>if (minIndex !== i) [list[i], list[minIndex]] = [list[minIndex], list[i]]</code>。能省掉自己和自己交换的写入，但比较次数一个没少，还是 <code>O(n²)</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>非要让选择排序稳定，有办法吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>有：找到最小值后不交换，而是把 <code>[i, minIndex)</code> 这段整体右移一格，再把最小值放到 <code>i</code>。这样稳定了，但每轮可能挪很多元素，它唯一的「交换少」优点也没了，还不如直接用插入排序。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>什么场景下选择排序比冒泡更合适？</strong></p>\\n<p>写入比比较贵得多的时候，比如每次写都要落到闪存，或者元素是很大的结构体要整块拷贝。冒泡最坏要换 <code>O(n²)</code> 次，选择最多换 <code>n-1</code> 次。前端日常基本碰不到这种场景。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"插入排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#插入排序\\">#</a> 插入排序</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>像理扑克牌：拿下一张，在已排好的部分从后往前找位置插进去</li>\\n<li>平均 / 最坏 <code>O(n²)</code>，有序时每个元素只比一次，最好 <code>O(n)</code>；空间 <code>O(1)</code>，稳定</li>\\n<li>内层是「后移」不是「交换」，一次赋值对三次，常数比冒泡小</li>\\n<li>三个 <code>O(n²)</code> 里最实用：近乎有序时飞快、原地、稳定，还能边收数据边排</li>\\n<li>真在用：<code>TimSort</code> 用二分插入把短 <code>run</code> 补到 <code>minrun</code>（<code>32~64</code>），很多快排在子数组小于 <code>16</code> 左右时也切插入排序</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>插入排序就是理扑克牌：左边是排好的，每次拿右边一张，从后往前找到位置插进去。</strong> 数据本来就基本有序时，每张牌比一次就到位，接近 <code>O(n)</code>，这是它比冒泡、选择强的地方。实现时我会让大的元素依次往后挪，最后把当前值放进空位，比反复交换少很多赋值；比较用 <code>&gt;</code>，相等就停，稳定性就保住了。所以它在真实的排序实现里一直有位置，<code>TimSort</code> 和很多快排处理小段数据时都会切到它。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>思路</strong>：把数组看成&quot;已排序区&quot;和&quot;未排序区&quot;，每次取未排序区的第一个元素，在已排序区里从后往前找到合适位置插入 —— 就像打牌时理手牌。</p>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>指标</th>\\n<th>值</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\\n<td>平均/最坏 <code>O(n²)</code>，<strong>最好 <code>O(n)</code></strong>（已有序时每个元素只比较一次）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(1)</code></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td><strong>稳定</strong></td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">insertionSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> cur <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 用 > 而不是 >=，相等时停下来插在后面 → 保证稳定</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> cur<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>     <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 后移而不是交换，比冒泡省一半写操作</span>\\n      j<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> cur\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>它是三个 <code>O(n²)</code> 算法里最实用的一个</strong>，原因有三：</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong>近乎有序的数据上极快</strong> —— 数据基本有序时接近 <code>O(n)</code>，而选择排序仍是 <code>O(n²)</code></li>\\n<li><strong>常数小</strong> —— 内层是&quot;后移&quot;不是&quot;交换&quot;，一次写操作 vs 三次</li>\\n<li><strong>稳定 + 原地 + 在线</strong>（可以边接收数据边排序）</li>\\n</ol>\\n<p><strong>所以它被真正用在了生产代码里</strong>：<code>V8</code> 的 <code>Array.prototype.sort</code>（TimSort）和大多数快排实现，在子数组长度小于某个阈值（通常 10~16）时都会切换成插入排序 —— 因为小数组上它的常数优势超过了 <code>O(n log n)</code> 算法的递归开销。</p>\\n<p><strong>希尔排序就是它的改进版</strong>：先让数组&quot;大致有序&quot;，再用插入排序收尾，正是利用了&quot;近乎有序时极快&quot;这个特性。</p>\\n<p>下面是具体实现：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>以第一个元素为有序数组，其后的元素通过在这个已有序的数组中找到合适的元素并插入。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<h3 id=\\"实现-3\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#实现-3\\">#</a> 实现</h3>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">insertSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">list</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> preIndex\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> current\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    preIndex <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n    current <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>preIndex <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>preIndex<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> current<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>preIndex <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>preIndex<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n      preIndex<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>preIndex <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> current\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> list\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<h3 id=\\"优化-2\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#优化-2\\">#</a> 优化</h3>\\n<h4 id=\\"拆半插入\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#拆半插入\\">#</a> 拆半插入</h4>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">insertSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">list</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> low\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> high\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> j\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n      low <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n      high <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>low <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> high<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>low <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> high<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n          low <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n          high <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> low<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n      list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> list\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>拆半插入用二分找位置，复杂度是不是降到 <code>O(n log n)</code> 了？</strong></p>\\n<p>没有。二分只把比较次数降到 <code>O(n log n)</code>，找到位置后还得把后面的元素一个个往右挪，移动次数还是 <code>O(n²)</code>。比较器很贵时有点用，数据量大照样慢。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>示例里二分遇到相等走 <code>high = mid - 1</code>，有什么问题？</strong></p>\\n<p>新元素会插到相等元素的前面，稳定性没了。想稳定就让相等时往右走：<code>if (temp &gt;= list[mid]) low = mid + 1; else high = mid - 1</code>，插到同值区间的最后面。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>外层那句 <code>if (list[i] &lt; list[i - 1])</code> 删掉会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p>结果还对，但已经比前一个大的元素也要做一遍二分，近乎有序的数据就白算了。留着它，有序的部分一次比较就跳过，保住插入排序「有序时快」的特点。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>后移结束后写成 <code>list[i] = temp</code>，<code>[2, 1]</code> 排完还是 <code>[2, 1]</code>，为什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>后移那一步已经把 <code>2</code> 挪到了下标 <code>1</code>，空出来的是下标 <code>0</code>，也就是 <code>low</code>，循环结束时 <code>j</code> 正好等于它。写回 <code>list[i]</code> 等于把 <code>1</code> 又放回原位，白排了。要写 <code>list[j] = temp</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>普通插入和拆半插入怎么选？</strong></p>\\n<p>看比较贵还是移动贵。比较器很重，比如多字段加 <code>localeCompare</code>，拆半能少比很多次；普通数字数组直接用普通插入，代码简单，常数也小。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"希尔排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#希尔排序\\">#</a> 希尔排序</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>带间隔的插入排序：先按大 <code>gap</code> 分组做插入排序，逐步缩小，最后 <code>gap = 1</code> 做一次普通插入</li>\\n<li>快在哪：大 <code>gap</code> 让元素一步跨很远，到 <code>gap = 1</code> 时数组已经基本有序，插入排序接近 <code>O(n)</code></li>\\n<li>复杂度看 <code>gap</code> 序列：每次除以 <code>2</code> 最坏 <code>O(n²)</code>，<code>Hibbard</code> 最坏 <code>O(n^1.5)</code>，<code>Sedgewick</code> 最坏约 <code>O(n^(4/3))</code></li>\\n<li>不稳定：同值元素可能分到不同组，各排各的，相对顺序就乱了</li>\\n<li>最优 <code>gap</code> 序列至今没有理论定论；工程上很少用，大数据用 <code>O(n log n)</code> 算法，小数据直接插入</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>希尔排序就是给插入排序加了个「步长」：先让隔得远的元素之间排好，再逐步缩小步长，最后步长为 <code>1</code> 时就是一次普通插入排序。</strong> 插入排序的问题是元素只能一格一格挪，最小值在末尾就得挪 <code>n</code> 次；希尔先用大步长把它快速带到前面，等到最后一轮数组已经接近有序，插入排序就很快。它的复杂度完全取决于步长序列，朴素的折半最坏还是 <code>O(n²)</code>。分组排序还会打乱同值元素的顺序，所以不稳定。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>思路</strong>：插入排序的改进版。先按一个较大的间隔（gap）把数组分成若干子序列分别做插入排序，然后逐步缩小 gap，最后 gap = 1 时再做一次完整的插入排序。</p>\\n<p><strong>为什么这样更快？</strong></p>\\n<p>插入排序的弱点是<strong>元素只能一格一格地移动</strong> —— 如果最小的元素在最末尾，它要一路挪到最前面，代价是 <code>O(n)</code>。</p>\\n<p>希尔排序让元素在大 gap 时能<strong>跨越式地大步移动</strong>，快速接近最终位置；等到 gap 缩小时数组已经&quot;大致有序&quot;，而插入排序在近乎有序的数据上接近 <code>O(n)</code>——两个特性正好互补。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">shellSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> gap <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> gap <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> gap <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>gap <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 对每个间隔为 gap 的子序列做插入排序</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> gap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> cur <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> gap\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> cur<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> gap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        j <span class=\\"token operator\\">-=</span> gap\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n      arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> gap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> cur\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>指标</th>\\n<th>值</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\\n<td><strong>取决于 gap 序列</strong>，从 <code>O(n²)</code> 到约 <code>O(n^1.3)</code> 不等</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(1)</code></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td><strong>不稳定</strong></td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p><strong>两个考点：</strong></p>\\n<p><strong>① 复杂度取决于 gap 序列，这是它最特别的地方。</strong> 上面用的是最朴素的&quot;每次除以 2&quot;（Shell 原始序列），最坏仍是 <code>O(n²)</code>。改用 Hibbard 序列（<code>2^k - 1</code>）能到 <code>O(n^1.5)</code>，Sedgewick 序列约 <code>O(n^1.3)</code>。目前<strong>还没有人从理论上完全分析清楚最优 gap 序列</strong> —— 这在算法里很少见，值得提一句。</p>\\n<p><strong>② 为什么不稳定？</strong> 因为相同的元素可能被分到不同的子序列里，各自独立排序时相对顺序就被打乱了。插入排序本身是稳定的，但&quot;分组&quot;这个动作破坏了稳定性。</p>\\n<p><strong>工程现状</strong>：希尔排序在实践中已经很少用了 —— <code>O(n log n)</code> 的算法（快排、归并、TimSort）在大数据量上稳定占优，而小数据量直接用插入排序即可。它的价值主要在教学上：<strong>展示了&quot;让算法先接近目标状态再收尾&quot;这个优化思路</strong>。</p>\\n<p>下面是具体实现：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>通过某个增量 gap，将整个序列分给若干组，从后往前进行组内成员的比较和交换，随后逐步缩小增量至 1。希尔排序类似于插入排序，只是一开始向前移动的步数从 1 变成了 gap。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">shellSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">list</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> gap <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">parseInt</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 初始化步数</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>gap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 逐步缩小步数</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> gap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 逐步和前面其他成员比较交换</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> gap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">-=</span> gap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> gap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n          <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> gap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n          list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> gap<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n          list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp\\n        <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n          <span class=\\"token keyword\\">break</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    gap <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">parseInt</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>gap <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>组内用的是稳定的插入排序，为什么希尔排序整体不稳定？</strong></p>\\n<p>比如 <code>[3, 2a, 2b, 1]</code>，<code>gap = 2</code> 时分成 <code>[3, 2b]</code> 和 <code>[2a, 1]</code> 两组，第一组排完 <code>2b</code> 跑到了下标 <code>0</code>，<code>2a</code> 被换到了最后，最终结果是 <code>[1, 2b, 2a, 3]</code>，顺序反了。组内稳定管不了跨组。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>页面上几千条接近有序的数据，同事想上希尔排序，你同意吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不同意。接近有序本来就是插入排序的主场，希尔最后一轮也就是插入排序，前面几轮反而是多出来的开销。几千条直接 <code>arr.sort()</code>，<code>TimSort</code> 对已有序的段有专门优化，比手写的快。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>折半 <code>gap</code> 序列最坏为什么会到 <code>O(n²)</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>n</code> 是 <code>2</code> 的幂时，折半出来的步长全是偶数，奇数位和偶数位的元素在 <code>gap = 1</code> 之前从来不互相比较。要是大数都在偶数位、小数都在奇数位，前面几轮等于白干，最后一轮插入排序要挪 <code>O(n²)</code> 次。换 <code>Hibbard</code>（<code>1, 3, 7, 15…</code>）这类相邻项互质的序列就能避开。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>什么场景下希尔排序还有用？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能递归、额外内存只有 <code>O(1)</code> 的环境，比如一些嵌入式代码。它代码短、原地、不用递归栈，中等规模数据表现也不差，比快排好写不容易出错。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>有人说换成 <code>Sedgewick</code> 序列就是理论最优了，对吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不对。<code>Sedgewick</code> 实测表现不错，最坏约 <code>O(n^(4/3))</code>，但最优步长序列到今天都没有证明出来，这也是希尔排序在算法里比较特别的地方。真要选，拿自己的数据跑个基准最实在。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"归并排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#归并排序\\">#</a> 归并排序</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>分治：从中间一分为二，递归排好两半，再合并两个有序数组</li>\\n<li>最好最坏平均都是 <code>O(n log n)</code>，不看输入分布；空间 <code>O(n)</code>；稳定</li>\\n<li>合并时写 <code>&lt;=</code>（相等先取左边）才稳定，一个字符决定稳定性</li>\\n<li>稳定又不退化，所以 <code>TimSort</code>（<code>V8</code> 的 <code>Array.prototype.sort</code>、<code>Python</code> 的 <code>sorted</code>、<code>Java</code> 对象数组排序）都以它为骨架</li>\\n<li>独门本事是外部排序：分块排好写磁盘，再多路归并，内存装不下也能排</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>归并排序就是先拆再合：数组对半拆到只剩一个元素，再两两合并成有序数组。</strong> 不管输入长什么样都是 <code>O(n log n)</code>，不会像快排那样遇到有序数据就退化，代价是合并要一块 <code>O(n)</code> 的额外空间。稳定性就看合并时那个比较，相等要先取左边，写 <code>&lt;=</code>。<code>V8</code> 从 <code>7.0</code> 开始把 <code>Array.prototype.sort</code> 换成了 <code>TimSort</code>，本质就是归并加插入排序，<code>ES2019</code> 也把「排序必须稳定」写进了规范。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>思路</strong>：典型的分治 —— 把数组从中间一分为二，递归排好左右两半，再把两个有序数组<strong>合并</strong>成一个。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">>></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">slice</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">slice</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">merge</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">merge</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">a<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> b</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> res <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> a<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> b<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// ⚠️ 用 &lt;= 而不是 &lt;：相等时优先取左边 → 保证稳定</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>a<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> b<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>a<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>b<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">concat</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>a<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">slice</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">concat</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>b<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">slice</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>指标</th>\\n<th>值</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\\n<td><strong>稳定 <code>O(n log n)</code></strong>——最好最坏平均都一样，不受输入分布影响</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(n)</code>（需要额外数组做合并）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td><strong>稳定</strong>（合并时相等取左边）</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p><strong>它的两个不可替代之处：</strong></p>\\n<p><strong>① 复杂度稳定，不怕最坏情况。</strong> 快排在数据已有序或大量重复时可能退化到 <code>O(n²)</code>，归并排序<strong>永远是 <code>O(n log n)</code></strong>。所以对&quot;最坏情况有硬性要求&quot;的场景（比如实时系统）会选它。</p>\\n<p><strong>② 是唯一常用的稳定 <code>O(n log n)</code> 排序。</strong> 需要多字段排序、或者排序结果要可复现时，稳定性是硬需求。<code>Java</code> 的 <code>Collections.sort</code>、<code>Python</code> 的 <code>sorted</code>、<code>V8</code> 的 <code>Array.sort</code> 用的 TimSort 都是归并排序的改良版，正是因为这一条。</p>\\n<p><strong>它的代价是 <code>O(n)</code> 额外空间</strong>（虽然有原地归并的变体，但常数太大不实用）。所以在内存紧张时快排更受欢迎。</p>\\n<p><strong>归并排序还有一个快排做不到的能力：外部排序。</strong></p>\\n<p>数据量大到内存装不下时（比如排序一个 100GB 的日志文件），可以把数据分块读进内存排好、写回磁盘，最后多路归并 —— 因为归并只需要顺序读取，对磁盘和网络这类&quot;顺序快、随机慢&quot;的介质非常友好。快排的随机访问模式做不到这一点。</p>\\n<p><strong>面试里能加分的一句</strong>：<code>merge</code> 里用 <code>&lt;=</code> 而不是 <code>&lt;</code>，这一个字符决定了整个算法稳不稳定。</p>\\n<p>下面是具体实现：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>递归将数组分成两个序列，有序合并这两个序列。作为一种典型的分治法思想算法应用，归并排序的实现有两种方法：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>自上而下的递归</li>\\n<li>自下而上的迭代</li>\\n</ul>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">list</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> list\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">slice</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">slice</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">merge</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mergeSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">merge</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> result <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      result<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">shift</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      result<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">shift</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    result<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">shift</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    result<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">shift</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> result\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>merge</code> 里把 <code>&lt;=</code> 改成 <code>&lt;</code>，结果有什么变化？</strong></p>\\n<p>排出来还是有序的，但相等时会先取右边，原来靠后的元素跑到前面，稳定性没了。比如订单先按时间排好再按状态归并，同状态订单的时间顺序就乱了。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>示例代码排几十万条时内存涨得厉害，问题在哪？</strong></p>\\n<p>每层递归都 <code>slice</code> 出新数组，<code>merge</code> 里又 <code>push</code> 一个新数组再 <code>concat</code> 两次，产生大量临时对象，<code>GC</code> 压力很大。改成按下标递归，只开一块和原数组一样大的辅助数组反复用，空间还是 <code>O(n)</code>，但分配次数少得多。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>100GB</code> 的日志文件要排序，内存只有 <code>8GB</code>，怎么做？</strong></p>\\n<p>外部排序：每次读进 <code>4GB</code> 左右排好写成一个有序文件，得到二十几个块；再用一个小顶堆做多路归并，每个块只读一小段缓冲，顺序读、顺序写。快排要随机访问，这事干不了。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>都说 <code>Array.prototype.sort</code> 不稳定，这说法现在还对吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>过时了。<code>Chrome 70</code> 之前，<code>V8</code> 对长度超过 <code>10</code> 的数组用快排，确实不稳定；<code>V8 7.0</code> 换成 <code>TimSort</code> 后就稳定了，<code>ES2019</code> 也要求 <code>sort</code> 必须稳定，现在主流浏览器和 <code>Node 11+</code> 都没问题。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>既要稳定，又不能接受最坏 <code>O(n²)</code>，归并和快排怎么选？</strong></p>\\n<p>选归并，这两条它都满足，快排一条都不保证。唯一要掂量的是 <code>O(n)</code> 额外空间，内存特别紧时再考虑别的，大多数前端场景这根本不是问题。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"快速排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#快速排序\\">#</a> 快速排序</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>选一个 <code>pivot</code>，小的放左边、大的放右边（分区），再递归两边</li>\\n<li>平均 <code>O(n log n)</code>，最坏 <code>O(n²)</code>；原地，递归栈 <code>O(log n)</code>；不稳定</li>\\n<li>退化：每次 <code>pivot</code> 都选到最值，典型是有序数组固定取首 / 尾元素</li>\\n<li>工业级三件套：随机或三数取中选 <code>pivot</code>、小数组切插入排序、三路划分对付大量重复值</li>\\n<li>实践中快是因为顺序扫描缓存友好、常数小；怕最坏就学 <code>C++</code> 的 <code>introsort</code>，递归过深切堆排序</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>快排就是选一个基准值，比它小的放左边、大的放右边，然后两边各自递归。</strong> 平均 <code>O(n log n)</code>，而且分区是顺序扫数组，缓存命中率高，实测往往比堆排序、归并都快。它的软肋是 <code>pivot</code> 选得不好：数组已经有序还固定拿最后一个当基准，每次只能分出一个元素，直接退化成 <code>O(n²)</code>，递归深度也到 <code>n</code>。所以真正能上生产的快排都会随机或三数取中选基准，重复值多就用三路划分。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>思路</strong>：分治。选一个基准值 pivot，把数组分成&quot;比它小的&quot;和&quot;比它大的&quot;两部分（这一步叫<strong>分区 partition</strong>），再递归排序两边。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> lo <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> hi <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span></span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>lo <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">partition</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> lo<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> lo<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">partition</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> lo<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> hi</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// ① 三数取中：避免对已有序数组退化</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> mid <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>lo <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">>></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>lo<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>lo<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>lo<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>lo<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>lo<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>lo<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>mid<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>   <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 中位数放到末尾当 pivot</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> pivot <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> lo\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> lo<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> pivot<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>hi<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> i\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>指标</th>\\n<th>值</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\\n<td>平均 <code>O(n log n)</code>，<strong>最坏 <code>O(n²)</code></strong></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(log n)</code>（递归栈），原地</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td><strong>不稳定</strong>（分区时是跨越式交换）</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p><strong>什么时候退化到 <code>O(n²)</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>当每次选的 pivot 都是当前区间的最值时，分区极度不平衡（一边 0 个、一边 n-1 个），递归深度变成 <code>n</code>。最典型的触发场景是 <strong>对已经有序的数组固定取第一个（或最后一个）元素做 pivot</strong> —— 而&quot;数据已经有序&quot;在真实业务里非常常见（比如从数据库按 id 顺序取出来的数据）。</p>\\n<p><strong>三个让它能上生产的优化：</strong></p>\\n<p><strong>① 选 pivot：随机 或 三数取中。</strong> 这是防退化的根本手段。上面代码用的是三数取中（首、中、尾取中位数），比纯随机更稳定且没有随机数开销。</p>\\n<p><strong>② 小数组切插入排序。</strong> 子数组长度小于 10~16 时递归开销超过收益，直接插入排序。所有工业级实现都有这一步。</p>\\n<p><strong>③ 三路划分处理大量重复元素。</strong> 普通两路分区遇到&quot;全是相同值&quot;的数组时，等于每次只能确定一个位置，退化成 <code>O(n²)</code>。三路划分把数组分成&quot;小于 / 等于 / 大于&quot;三段，等于的部分直接跳过，把这种场景降到 <code>O(n)</code>。</p>\\n<p><strong>它为什么在实践中最快？</strong></p>\\n<p>原地（不像归并要 <code>O(n)</code> 额外空间）、常数小、<strong>缓存局部性极好</strong>——分区是顺序扫描数组，<code>CPU</code> 缓存命中率高。这一点在实测中比渐进复杂度的影响还大，也是堆排序虽然最坏更好却更慢的原因。</p>\\n<p><strong>什么时候不该选它</strong>：需要<strong>稳定性</strong>（选归并）、或者<strong>不能接受最坏 <code>O(n²)</code></strong>（实时系统选归并或堆排序）。C++ 的 <code>introsort</code> 的做法是：快排为主，递归太深时自动切换成堆排序兜底 —— 两全其美。</p>\\n<p>下面是更多实现细节：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>选择一个元素作为基数，把比基数小的元素放在它左边，比它大的放在右边（相当于二分），再不断递归基数左右的序列。快速排序是一种分而治之思想在排序算法上的典型应用。本质上来看，快速排序应该算是在冒泡排序基础上递归分治法。快速排序的名字起的是简单粗暴，因为一听到这个名字你就知道它存在的意义，它是处理大数据最快的排序算法之一。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<h3 id=\\"实现一\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#实现一\\">#</a> 实现一</h3>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> baseIndex <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span><span class=\\"token comment\\">//向下取整，选取基准点</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> base <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">splice</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>baseIndex<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span><span class=\\"token comment\\">//取出基准点的值，</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// splice 通过删除或替换现有元素或者原地添加新的元素来修改数组,并以数组形式返回被修改的内容。此方法会改变原数组。</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// slice方法返回一个新的数组对象,不会更改原数组</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">//这里不能直接base=arr[baseIndex],因为base代表的每次都删除的那个数</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> left<span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> right<span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 这里的length是变化的，因为splice会改变原数组。</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> base<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span><span class=\\"token comment\\">//比基准点小的放在左边数组，</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span><span class=\\"token comment\\">//比基准点大的放在右边数组，</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">concat</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>base<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span><span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<h3 id=\\"实现二\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#实现二\\">#</a> 实现二</h3>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span></span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n\\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> left <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        index<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n        list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">quickSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> list\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>接口返回的数据已经按 <code>id</code> 升序，这段代码排起来特别慢，为什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>它固定拿 <code>list[right]</code> 当 <code>pivot</code>，升序数组里末尾就是最大值，每次分区都是左边 <code>n-1</code> 个、右边 <code>0</code> 个，退化成 <code>O(n²)</code>，递归深度也接近 <code>n</code>。数据量上去就可能栈溢出。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>怎么改才能防住这种退化？</strong></p>\\n<p>分区前随机挑一个位置和 <code>right</code> 交换：<code>const r = left + Math.floor(Math.random() * (right - left + 1))</code>，再把 <code>list[r]</code> 和 <code>list[right]</code> 对调。或者用三数取中。这样有序输入也能大致对半分。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>数据里全是几种状态码，大量重复值为什么也会变慢？</strong></p>\\n<p>条件是 <code>list[i] &lt;= list[right]</code>，和 <code>pivot</code> 相等的全被扔到左边，全一样的数组每次还是只分出一个。用三路划分，把等于 <code>pivot</code> 的放中间一段，下次递归直接跳过它。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>循环写成 <code>i &lt;= right</code>，<code>pivot</code> 自己也参与比较，是不是写错了？</strong></p>\\n<p>不是，这是故意的。最后一次比较 <code>pivot</code> 和自己相等，会被换到 <code>index</code> 位置，正好落在分界点上，接下来递归 <code>[left, index - 1]</code> 和 <code>[index + 1, right]</code> 就把它排除了。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>线上偶发 <code>Maximum call stack size exceeded</code>，除了换 <code>pivot</code> 还能怎么兜底？</strong></p>\\n<p>只对较短的那一边递归，较长的那一边改成循环处理，栈深度就能压到 <code>O(log n)</code>。再稳一点学 <code>introsort</code>，递归深度超过 <code>2 log n</code> 直接切堆排序。前端业务代码的话，直接用 <code>arr.sort()</code> 最省事。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"堆排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#堆排序\\">#</a> 堆排序</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>先原地建大顶堆，再反复「堆顶和末尾交换 → 堆范围减一 → 新堆顶下沉」</li>\\n<li>时间恒定 <code>O(n log n)</code>，空间 <code>O(1)</code>，不稳定</li>\\n<li>自底向上建堆是 <code>O(n)</code>：底层节点多但下沉距离短，求和收敛到约 <code>2n</code></li>\\n<li>唯一同时做到「最坏 <code>O(n log n)</code> + 原地 <code>O(1)</code>」；但跳跃访问缓存不友好，实际比快排慢，常给快排兜底</li>\\n<li>主场是 <code>TopK</code>：维护大小为 <code>k</code> 的堆，<code>O(n log k)</code>；求最大的 <code>k</code> 个用小顶堆</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>堆排序分两步：先把数组原地调成大顶堆，然后每次把堆顶的最大值换到末尾，堆缩小一格，再把新堆顶往下沉。</strong> 它最坏也是 <code>O(n log n)</code>，还不需要额外空间，这个组合在常见排序里只有它有。缺点是下沉时下标按 <code>i → 2i+1</code> 跳着访问，缓存命中差，实际跑起来比快排慢，所以一般拿来给快排兜底。面试里更常考的是它的变体 <code>TopK</code>，还有为什么建堆是 <code>O(n)</code>。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>思路</strong>：利用堆这个数据结构 —— 先把数组原地建成<strong>大顶堆</strong>（每个父节点都不小于子节点），然后反复做三步：把堆顶（最大值）和当前堆的最后一个元素交换、堆的有效范围减一、对新堆顶做下沉调整。<code>n-1</code> 次之后数组就有序了。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">heapSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// ① 建堆：从最后一个非叶节点开始倒着下沉 —— 这一步是 O(n) 不是 O(n log n)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n <span class=\\"token operator\\">>></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">siftDown</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// ② 反复取堆顶放到末尾</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> n <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">siftDown</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">siftDown</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> size</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token boolean\\">true</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> l <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> r <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>l <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> size <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>l<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> l\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>r <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> size <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>r<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> r\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>max <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">break</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> max\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>指标</th>\\n<th>值</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\\n<td><strong>稳定 <code>O(n log n)</code></strong>（不受输入分布影响）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\\n<td><strong><code>O(1)</code></strong>（完全原地，连递归栈都不需要）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td><strong>不稳定</strong></td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p><strong>一个高频追问：为什么建堆是 <code>O(n)</code> 而不是 <code>O(n log n)</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>直觉上 n 个节点每个下沉 <code>log n</code> 层应该是 <code>O(n log n)</code>，但实际上：<strong>越靠近底部的节点越多，而它们能下沉的距离越短</strong>。第 h 层有约 <code>n/2^h</code> 个节点，每个最多下沉 <code>h</code> 层，求和 <code>Σ (n/2^h) × h</code> 收敛到 <code>2n</code>——所以是 <code>O(n)</code>。能推出这一步是很好的加分点。</p>\\n<p><strong>它的独特价值：唯一同时满足&quot;最坏 <code>O(n log n)</code> + 原地 <code>O(1)</code> 空间&quot;的排序。</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>归并：<code>O(n log n)</code> 但要 <code>O(n)</code> 额外空间</li>\\n<li>快排：原地但最坏 <code>O(n²)</code></li>\\n<li>堆排序：两个都满足</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>但实践中它通常比快排慢</strong> —— 因为 <code>siftDown</code> 是跳跃式访问（<code>i → 2i+1 → 4i+3</code>），对 <code>CPU</code> 缓存极不友好；快排的分区是顺序扫描，缓存命中率高得多，实测常常快好几倍。</p>\\n<p>所以堆排序在通用排序里的定位是<strong>兜底</strong>：C++ 的 <code>introsort</code> 就是快排为主、递归深度超过阈值时切换成堆排序，既拿到快排的速度又保住了最坏情况。</p>\\n<p><strong>它真正的主场是 <code>TopK</code></strong>：维护一个大小为 k 的堆遍历数据，复杂度 <code>O(n log k)</code>、空间 <code>O(k)</code>——这是全排序做不到的。</p>\\n<p>下面是具体实现：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>说到堆排序，首先需要了解一种数据结构--堆。堆是一种完全二叉树，这种结构通常可以用数组表示。在实际应用中，堆又可以分为最小堆和最大堆，两者区别如下：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>-max-heap property：对于所有除了根节点的节点i，A[Parent(i)] &gt;= A[i]</li>\\n<li>-min-heap property：对于除了根节点的节点i，A[Parent(i)] &lt;= A[i]</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>堆排序可以说是一种利用堆的概念来排序的选择排序，分为两种方法：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>大顶堆：每个节点的值都大于或等于其子节点的值，在堆排序算法中用于升序排序；</li>\\n<li>小顶堆：每个节点的值都小于或等于其子节点的值，在堆排序算法中用于降序排序。</li>\\n</ul>\\n</blockquote>\\n<h3 id=\\"实现-4\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#实现-4\\">#</a> 实现</h3>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">heapSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">list</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">buildHeap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 循环 n-1 次，每次循环后交换堆顶元素和堆底元素并重新调整堆结构</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">adjustHeap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> list\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">buildHeap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">nums</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 注意这里的头节点是从0开始的，所以最后一个非叶子节点结果是 parseInt(nums.length / 2) - 1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> start <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">parseInt</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> size <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 从最后一个非叶子节点开始调整，直至堆顶</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> start<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">adjustHeap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> size<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">adjustHeap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> size</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 交换后可能会破坏堆结构，需要循环使得每一个父节点都大于左右节点</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token boolean\\">true</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> index\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> left <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 左节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> right <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 右节点</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>left <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> size <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>left<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> left\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>right <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> size <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>right<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> right\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 如果左右节点大雨当前节点则交换，并在循环一遍判断交换后是否破坏堆结构</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>index <span class=\\"token operator\\">!==</span> max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n      index <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> max\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">break</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>示例代码一跑就报 <code>nums is not defined</code>，问题在哪？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>heapSort</code> 的参数叫 <code>list</code>，循环里却写的 <code>nums[i]</code> 和 <code>adjustHeap(nums, 0, i)</code>；<code>buildHeap</code> 能跑是因为它自己的参数就叫 <code>nums</code>。把循环里的 <code>nums</code> 都改成 <code>list</code> 就好。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>一亿条数据里找最大的 <code>100</code> 条，要先整体堆排序吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不用。维护一个容量 <code>100</code> 的小顶堆，新值比堆顶大才替换堆顶再下沉，时间 <code>O(n log 100)</code>，内存只占 <code>100</code> 个元素，数据流式读进来也能做。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>求最大的 <code>k</code> 个，为什么用小顶堆而不是大顶堆？</strong></p>\\n<p>小顶堆的堆顶是当前候选里最小的那个，也就是「门槛」。新来的数比门槛大就踢掉门槛，<code>O(log k)</code> 调整一下；大顶堆的堆顶是最大值，没法快速知道该淘汰谁。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>每个节点都可能下沉 <code>log n</code> 层，建堆为什么是 <code>O(n)</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>只有根节点要沉 <code>log n</code> 层，一半的节点是叶子根本不用沉，倒数第二层那 <code>n/4</code> 个最多沉一层。按层加起来 <code>Σ (n/2^h) × h</code> 收敛到 <code>2n</code>。逐个插入建堆才是 <code>O(n log n)</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>同价商品要保持上架顺序，内存又紧，能用堆排序吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能直接用，堆顶和末尾一交换，同价商品的顺序就乱了。实在要用，就把原始下标作为第二比较字段，<code>(a, b) =&gt; a.price - b.price || a.idx - b.idx</code>，等于手动补上稳定性。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"计数排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#计数排序\\">#</a> 计数排序</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>不比较：把值当下标，数每个值出现几次，再按值从小到大输出，所以能绕开 <code>O(n log n)</code> 下界</li>\\n<li><code>O(n + k)</code>，<code>k</code> 是值域跨度；空间 <code>O(n + k)</code>；前缀和 + 倒序回填才稳定</li>\\n<li>值域 <code>k</code> 远大于 <code>n</code> 就别用：排 <code>10</code> 个百万范围的数要开百万长度的数组</li>\\n<li>适合整数且值域集中：年龄、分数、状态码、月份</li>\\n<li>示例实现最后 <code>return list</code> 返回的是计数数组，排好的结果其实在 <code>nums</code> 里</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>计数排序不做比较，而是开一个数组，把每个值当下标，数一数每个值出现了几次，再按顺序吐出来。</strong> 所以它能做到 <code>O(n + k)</code>，比比较排序的 <code>O(n log n)</code> 下界还快，代价是 <code>k</code> 也就是值域不能太大，排分数（<code>0~100</code>）很合适，排时间戳就不行。只排数字的话按次数回写就够了；要排的是对象、还要稳定，就得先做前缀和算出每个值的结束位置，再从后往前把元素放进结果数组，基数排序就靠这一步。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>思路</strong>：不比较元素，而是统计每个值出现的次数，再按值从小到大依次输出。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">countingSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> min <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">min</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">max</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> count <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>max <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> min <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">fill</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> v <span class=\\"token keyword\\">of</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> count<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>v <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>        <span class=\\"token comment\\">// ① 统计次数</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// ② 累加成\\"前缀和\\"，得到每个值在结果里的结束位置</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> count<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> count<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+=</span> count<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> res <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// ③ ⚠️ 必须倒序遍历原数组才能保证稳定</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>count<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> res\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>指标</th>\\n<th>值</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(n + k)</code>，k 是值域大小</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(n + k)</code></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td><strong>稳定</strong>（前提是倒序回填）</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p><strong>它为什么能突破 <code>O(n log n)</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>因为它<strong>不做比较</strong>。基于比较的排序有 <code>O(n log n)</code> 的理论下界（决策树模型可以证明），而计数排序是&quot;按值索引&quot;，绕开了这个下界 —— 代价是只能用于<strong>整数或可映射为整数</strong>的数据。</p>\\n<p><strong>关键限制：值域 k 不能太大。</strong></p>\\n<p>排序 <code>[1, 1000000]</code> 范围内的 10 个数，要开一百万长度的数组 —— 时间和空间都被 k 主导，还不如直接排序。所以适用条件是 <strong>k 与 n 同数量级</strong>，比如年龄（0~150）、分数（0~100）、状态码。</p>\\n<p><strong>两个容易答错的细节：</strong></p>\\n<p><strong>① 为什么要做前缀和？</strong> 直接按次数输出也能排序，但那样会<strong>丢失原始元素</strong>——只知道&quot;3 出现了两次&quot;，不知道这两个 3 分别关联着什么数据。做前缀和 + 回填才能保留完整对象，才能作为基数排序的子过程使用。</p>\\n<p><strong>② 为什么必须倒序回填？</strong> 正序回填会让相同值的元素顺序颠倒，破坏稳定性。而基数排序<strong>依赖计数排序的稳定性</strong>才能工作（低位排好的顺序要在高位排序时保留下来），所以这不是可选项。</p>\\n<p>下面是具体实现：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>以数组元素值为键，出现次数为值存进一个临时数组，最后再遍历这个临时数组还原回原数组。因为 JS 的数组下标是以字符串形式存储的，所以计数排序可以用来排列负数，但是不可以排列小数。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<h3 id=\\"实现-5\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#实现-5\\">#</a> 实现</h3>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">countingSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">nums</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> list <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">max</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> min <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">min</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n    list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>temp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>temp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">||</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>index<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> i\\n      list<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> list\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>示例函数最后 <code>return list</code>，调用方拿到的是什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>拿到的是计数数组，不是排序结果。排好的数据其实原地写回了 <code>nums</code>，应该 <code>return nums</code>。这种错误一个单测就能发现，面试手写时很容易漏。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>传入负数，<code>list[-3]</code> 这种写法能正常排吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>能排出来，因为回写循环是从 <code>min</code> 遍历到 <code>max</code>，<code>list[-3]</code> 读写的是一个叫 <code>&quot;-3&quot;</code> 的普通属性。但它不算数组元素，<code>length</code> 不管它，数组还可能退化成字典模式变慢。规范写法是做偏移：<code>count[v - min]++</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>一千万个整数，值域从 <code>-10^9</code> 到 <code>10^9</code>，能用计数排序吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能。要开 <code>2×10^9</code> 长度的计数数组，内存直接爆，<code>k</code> 远大于 <code>n</code> 时 <code>O(n + k)</code> 一点都不线性。这种老老实实用比较排序，或者换基数排序。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>对象数组按年龄排、同龄保持原顺序，这段代码为什么不够用？</strong></p>\\n<p>它只回写了数值，对象本身丢了。要先做前缀和得到每个年龄的结束位置，再从后往前遍历原数组：<code>res[--count[p.age - min]] = p</code>，这样同龄的人顺序不变。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>Math.max(...nums)</code> 在数据量很大时有什么坑？</strong></p>\\n<p>展开运算符是把所有元素当函数参数传进去，几十万个元素就可能直接抛 <code>RangeError</code>。大数组用一个循环自己求 <code>min</code> 和 <code>max</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"桶排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#桶排序\\">#</a> 桶排序</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>按值域把数据分到若干个桶，桶内各自排序（通常插入排序），再按桶的顺序拼起来</li>\\n<li>理想接近 <code>O(n + k)</code>；全挤进一个桶就退化成桶内算法的复杂度，插入排序是 <code>O(n²)</code>；空间 <code>O(n + k)</code></li>\\n<li>稳定性看桶内算法，插入排序就稳定</li>\\n<li>前提是数据分布均匀；计数排序只要值域小，不管分布，它是「一个值一个桶」的特例</li>\\n<li>边界：最大值的下标要钳到 <code>bucketCount - 1</code>、<code>min === max</code> 要提前返回；分布已知就按分位数划桶</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>桶排序就是先按范围分组，比如分数 <code>0~9</code> 一个桶、<code>10~19</code> 一个桶，每个桶内部排好，再按顺序拼起来。</strong> 数据分得越均匀，每个桶越小，桶内排序就越便宜，整体接近线性。它的性能全押在分布上，要是大部分数据挤在一个桶里，就等于对整个数组跑了一遍插入排序。实际业务里很少手写桶排序，但「先粗分、再局部处理」这个思路到处都是，日志按小时分片、订单按金额分档都是这个意思。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>思路</strong>：把数据按值域<strong>均匀分配到若干个桶</strong>里，每个桶内部单独排序，最后按桶的顺序依次拼接。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">bucketSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> bucketCount <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">10</span></span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> min <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">min</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">max</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>min <span class=\\"token operator\\">===</span> max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> buckets <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">from</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span> <span class=\\"token literal-property property\\">length</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> bucketCount <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> size <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>max <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> bucketCount\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> v <span class=\\"token keyword\\">of</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 注意边界：最大值要落进最后一个桶，否则索引越界</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> idx <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">min</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> size<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> bucketCount <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    buckets<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>idx<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 桶内用插入排序 —— 桶小时最快，而且它稳定</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> buckets<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">flatMap</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">b</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">insertionSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>b<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>指标</th>\\n<th>值</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\\n<td><strong>理想 <code>O(n + k)</code></strong>（数据均匀、桶数合适）；<strong>最坏 <code>O(n²)</code></strong>（全落进一个桶）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(n + k)</code></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td><strong>取决于桶内排序算法</strong>（用插入排序就稳定）</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p><strong>核心前提：数据必须均匀分布。</strong></p>\\n<p>这是它和计数排序最大的区别 —— 计数排序只要求&quot;值域有限&quot;，不管分布如何；桶排序的性能<strong>完全押注在分布均匀性</strong>上。如果数据全挤进一个桶，就退化成&quot;对整个数组做一次插入排序&quot;，即 <code>O(n²)</code>。</p>\\n<p><strong>桶数怎么选？</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>太少 → 每个桶元素太多，退化成桶内排序的复杂度</li>\\n<li>太多 → 空桶的遍历开销和内存浪费</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>经验值是让<strong>平均每个桶 1~10 个元素</strong>，也就是桶数取 <code>n/5</code> 左右。数据分布已知时可以按分位数划分桶边界，比等宽划分均匀得多。</p>\\n<p><strong>它和计数排序、基数排序的关系：</strong></p>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th></th>\\n<th>桶的含义</th>\\n<th>适用数据</th>\\n<th>依赖</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>计数排序</td>\\n<td>一个值一个桶</td>\\n<td>值域有限的整数</td>\\n<td>值域不能太大</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>桶排序</td>\\n<td>一个区间一个桶</td>\\n<td>浮点数、值域大的数据</td>\\n<td><strong>分布均匀</strong></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>基数排序</td>\\n<td>按位分桶，排 d 轮</td>\\n<td>可按位拆分的数据</td>\\n<td>子过程必须稳定</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p>可以说<strong>计数排序是桶排序在&quot;每个桶只放一个值&quot;时的特例</strong>。</p>\\n<p><strong>实际项目里的价值</strong>：直接手写桶排序很少，但&quot;先分桶再局部处理&quot;这个思路到处都是 —— 订单按金额分档统计、日志按时间窗口分片、<code>MapReduce</code> 的 shuffle、数据库的分区表。理解它的价值不在实现，而在这个思路。</p>\\n<p>下面是具体实现：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>取 n 个桶，根据数组的最大值和最小值确认每个桶存放的数的区间，将元素插入到相应的桶里，最后再合并各个桶。</p>\\n<p>桶排序是计数排序的升级版。它利用了函数的映射关系，高效与否的关键就在于这个映射函数的确定。 为了使桶排序更加高效，我们需要做到这两点：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>在额外空间充足的情况下，尽量增大桶的数量。</li>\\n<li>使用的映射函数能够将输入的N个数据均匀的分配到K个桶中。</li>\\n</ul>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">bucketSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">nums</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 桶的个数，只要是正数都行</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> num <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">5</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">max</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> min <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">min</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 计算每个桶存放的数值范围，至少为 1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> range <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">ceil</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>max <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> num<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">||</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 创建二维数组，第一维表示第几个桶，第二维表示桶里放的数</span>\\n\\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> arr <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">from</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token function\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>num<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">map</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">fill</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">forEach</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">val</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  \\t<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 计算元素应该分布在哪个桶</span>\\n   \\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">parseInt</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>val <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> min<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> range<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 防止index越界，例如当[5,1,1,2,0,0]时index会出现5</span>\\n    index <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> num <span class=\\"token operator\\">?</span> num <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 插入排序，将元素有序插入到桶中</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">&amp;&amp;</span> val <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> temp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    \\ttemp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      j<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    temp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> val<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\t<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 修改回原数组</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> res <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">concat</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">apply</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">forEach</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">val<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> i</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  \\tnums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>桶排序和计数排序都有「桶」，区别是什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>计数排序一个值一个桶，桶里不用再排，所以只适合值域小的整数。桶排序一个区间一个桶，桶里还要排，所以浮点数、大值域都能用，但要求分布均匀。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>10</code> 万条均匀分布的评分，桶数怎么定？</strong></p>\\n<p>按平均每桶 <code>5~10</code> 个来算，大概一两万个桶。太少桶内排序变贵，太多空桶遍历和内存都浪费。定好后跑一遍看看最大的桶有多大，心里就有数了。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>活动分数大部分挤在 <code>99~100</code>，等宽分桶会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p>几乎全进最后一两个桶，桶内插入排序接近整体 <code>O(n²)</code>。分布已知就按分位数划桶边界，让每个桶数量差不多；分布未知又很偏，干脆直接用 <code>arr.sort()</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>线上偶尔丢了最大值，代码里是 <code>buckets[idx].push(v)</code>，先查什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>先查最大值的下标：<code>(max - min) / size</code> 正好等于 <code>bucketCount</code>，越界了，<code>buckets[bucketCount]</code> 是 <code>undefined</code>，<code>push</code> 会直接报错，外面吞了异常就表现为丢数据。用 <code>Math.min(idx, bucketCount - 1)</code> 钳住。再查 <code>min === max</code> 时桶宽是 <code>0</code>，<code>0 / 0</code> 会得到 <code>NaN</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>桶排序的思路在前端还能用在哪？</strong></p>\\n<p>埋点按分钟分桶聚合后再上报、大量日志按时间窗口分组渲染、虚拟列表按区段缓存行高。本质都是先粗分、再细处理，减少每次要处理的数据量。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h2 id=\\"基数排序\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#基数排序\\">#</a> 基数排序</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>按位排：从最低位到最高位（<code>LSD</code>），每一位做一次稳定的计数排序，排完 <code>d</code> 轮整体有序</li>\\n<li><code>O(d × (n + k))</code>，<code>d</code> 是位数、<code>k</code> 是每位取值数（十进制是 <code>10</code>）；空间 <code>O(n + k)</code>；稳定</li>\\n<li>子过程必须稳定，这是正确性前提：排十位时要保住个位排好的顺序</li>\\n<li><code>MSD</code> 从高位开始，要对每个分组递归，适合变长字符串（高位不同就能提前分开）</li>\\n<li><code>d</code> 远小于 <code>log n</code> 时才划算，比如一亿个 <code>11</code> 位手机号；负数、小数要先做映射</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>基数排序是一位一位地排：先按个位排一遍，再按十位排一遍，一直排到最高位，结束时整体就有序了。</strong> 关键在每一轮都必须用稳定的排序，因为排十位的时候，十位相同的数要保住上一轮按个位排出来的顺序，不稳定的话前面几轮就白排了。所以子过程一般是倒序回填的计数排序。它的复杂度是 <code>O(d × (n + k))</code>，位数少、数据量大时比快排划算，比如排一大批定长手机号；位数很长或者没法按位拆的数据就不合适。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><strong>思路</strong>：不整体比较，而是<strong>按数位一轮轮排序</strong>。从最低位（个位）开始，每一位用一次<strong>稳定的计数排序</strong>做分配，全部位排完后整体有序。这叫 <code>LSD</code>（Least Significant Digit）方式。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">radixSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">max</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> exp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>max <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> exp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">></span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> exp <span class=\\"token operator\\">*=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">10</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    arr <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">countingSortByDigit</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> exp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> arr\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">countingSortByDigit</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> exp</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> count <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">10</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">fill</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> v <span class=\\"token keyword\\">of</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> count<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> exp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">%</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">10</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">10</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> count<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+=</span> count<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> res <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// ⚠️ 必须倒序 —— 保证稳定性，这是基数排序正确性的前提</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> d <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">floor</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> exp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">%</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">10</span>\\n    res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span>count<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>d<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> res\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>指标</th>\\n<th>值</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(d × (n + k))</code>，d = 最大位数，k = 每位取值范围（十进制为 10）</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\\n<td><code>O(n + k)</code></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>稳定性</td>\\n<td><strong>稳定</strong></td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p><strong>两个必须讲清的点：</strong></p>\\n<p><strong>① 为什么从低位开始（LSD）？</strong></p>\\n<p>因为低位先排、高位后排时，<strong>高位相同的元素会自动保持低位排好的顺序</strong> —— 这正是稳定排序的定义。所以一遍走下来结果就是正确的，不需要任何回溯。</p>\\n<p>如果从高位开始（<code>MSD</code>），高位排完后必须对每个分组<strong>递归</strong>处理低位，实现复杂得多（但 <code>MSD</code> 在处理变长字符串时有优势，可以提前剪枝）。</p>\\n<p><strong>② 为什么子过程必须是稳定排序？</strong></p>\\n<p>这是基数排序<strong>正确性的前提</strong>，不是优化选项。高位那一轮排序时必须保留低位已排好的相对顺序 —— 比如 <code>23</code> 和 <code>21</code> 在个位排序后 <code>21</code> 在前，十位都是 2 时这个顺序不能被打乱。用不稳定的排序（快排）做子过程，整个算法直接失效。</p>\\n<p>这也解释了为什么计数排序回填时&quot;必须倒序遍历&quot;——在这里它是硬性要求。</p>\\n<p><strong>什么时候比快排快？</strong></p>\\n<p>当 <code>d</code> 远小于 <code>log n</code> 时。排一亿个手机号（11 位定长）：基数排序 <code>O(11n)</code>，快排约 <code>O(27n)</code>——基数明显更快。但如果是长度不一的长字符串，<code>d</code> 很大就不划算了。</p>\\n<p><strong>实际限制</strong>：需要 <code>O(n)</code> 额外空间、缓存局部性不如快排、只适用于可按位拆分的数据（整数、定长字符串、日期）。所以通用场景仍是快排/TimSort 的天下。</p>\\n<p>下面是具体实现：</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>使用十个桶 0-9，把每个数从低位到高位根据位数放到相应的桶里，以此循环最大值的位数次。但只能排列正整数，因为遇到负号和小数点无法进行比较。</p>\\n<p>基数排序有两种方法：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>MSD 从高位开始进行排序</li>\\n<li>LSD 从低位开始进行排序</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>基数排序 vs 计数排序 vs 桶排序：</p>\\n<p>这三种排序算法都利用了桶的概念，但对桶的使用方法上有明显差异：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>基数排序：根据键值的每位数字来分配桶</li>\\n<li>计数排序：每个桶只存储单一键值</li>\\n<li>桶排序：每个桶存储一定范围的数值</li>\\n</ul>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">radixSort</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">nums</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 计算位数</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">getDigits</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">n</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  \\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> sum <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    \\tsum<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      n <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">parseInt</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>n <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">10</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> sum<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 第一维表示位数即0-9，第二维表示里面存放的值</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> arr <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">from</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token function\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">10</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">map</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> max <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">max</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> maxDigits <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">getDigits</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>max<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> len <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> len<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  \\t<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 用0把每一个数都填充成相同的位数</span>\\n    nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\'\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">padStart</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>maxDigits<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 先根据个位数把每一个数放到相应的桶里</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>temp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 循环判断每个位数</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> maxDigits <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  \\t<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 循环每一个桶</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">9</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> j<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    \\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> temp <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>j<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> len <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 根据当前的位数i把桶里的数放到相应的桶里</span>\\n      \\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>len<span class=\\"token operator\\">--</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n          <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> str <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> temp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n          temp<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">shift</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n          arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>str<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>i<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>str<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n       \\t<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 修改回原数组</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> res <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">concat</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">apply</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> arr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">forEach</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">val<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    \\tnums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> nums<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>为什么 <code>LSD</code> 从低位开始？先排高位再排低位行不行？</strong></p>\\n<p>不行。最后一轮说了算，先高后低的话，最后按个位整体一排，结果就成了按个位有序。从低位开始，最后一轮按最高位排，最高位相同的再靠稳定性保住低位的顺序，正好就是「先比高位、相同再比低位」。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>每一位的排序换成快排可以吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不行，快排不稳定。比如 <code>21</code> 和 <code>23</code> 按个位排完是 <code>21</code> 在前，排十位时两者都是 <code>2</code>，快排可能把它们换过来，结果就错了。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>计数回填从前往后遍历会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p>配合 <code>res[--count[d]]</code> 这种从结束位置往前放的写法，从前往后遍历会把同一位相同的元素顺序反过来，稳定性没了，整个 <code>LSD</code> 就断了。要么倒序遍历，要么把前缀和改成起始位置再正序放。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>数据里有负数怎么办？</strong></p>\\n<p>示例代码只支持非负整数。简单的办法是整体加偏移量 <code>-min</code> 变成非负再排，排完减回去；或者正负分开，负数取绝对值排好再反转拼到前面。小数一般乘固定倍数转成整数，精度要事先约定。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>一亿个手机号排序，基数排序一定比快排快吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>理论上 <code>11</code> 轮线性扫描，对比快排约 <code>27</code> 层（<code>log₂ 10^8 ≈ 27</code>），基数排序占优。但它要 <code>O(n)</code> 辅助数组，每轮全量搬一遍数据，缓存也不友好，实际快多少得压测。还可以两位一组做基数（<code>k = 100</code>），轮数减半。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n"}')}}]);